:: PDX
<<nobr>>
<<castleDoorTitle "¿Puedes Descubrir la X?">>
<section class="pdx-room" aria-label="Laberinto de la X">
    <p>Busca tres poemas y sigue sus versos hasta la X. Cada vez que avances darás un paso.</p>
    <label class="pdx-choice">Laberinto
        <select class="pdx-picker">
            <option value="pdx-v1">1 · El laberinto de la X</option>
            <option value="pdx-v2">2 · El secreto de la torre</option>
        </select>
    </label>
    <p class="pdx-status" role="status">Cargando el laberinto…</p>
    <button type="button" data-pdx-action="retry" hidden>Reintentar</button>
    <div class="pdx-game" hidden>
        <p class="pdx-location" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <div class="pdx-view" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="pdx-facet pdx-ceiling"></div>
            <div class="pdx-facet pdx-floor"></div>
            <div class="pdx-facet pdx-wall pdx-wall-left"></div>
            <div class="pdx-facet pdx-wall pdx-wall-right"></div>
            <div class="pdx-facet pdx-wall pdx-wall-front"></div>
            <div class="pdx-objects"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="pdx-placeholder"></p>
        <div class="pdx-controls" role="group" aria-label="Controles del laberinto">
            <span class="pdx-heading" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="left">↶ Girar a la izquierda</button>
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="forward">↑ Avanzar</button>
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="right">↷ Girar a la derecha</button>
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="up" hidden>Subir escaleras</button>
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="down" hidden>Bajar escaleras</button>
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="inspect" hidden>Examinar la piedra suelta</button>
        </div>
        <p class="pdx-return-help">Primero tienes que descubrir un poema.</p>
        <div class="pdx-controls" role="group" aria-label="Acciones de la aventura">
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="return-clue" disabled>Volver a la última pista</button>
            <button type="button" data-pdx-action="new-adventure">Nueva aventura</button>
        </div>
        <details class="pdx-journal">
            <summary class="pdx-journal-title">Cuaderno de pistas</summary>
            <div class="pdx-verses"></div>
        </details>
    </div>
</section>
<<castleDoorReturn>>
<</nobr>>
